Spider Flower was an [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Arachnid Arachnid] added in '''Beta 46.0. '''It's a 4G 2/2 monster with a Magic of summoning a Green Flower (an effectless 1/1 [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Plant Plant] Token). It also had a Synergy which gave the summoned Green Flower +2/+2 Base Stats (boosting it to 3/3). '''Beta 52.1''' changed that to make it summon a Red Flower instead (also a 3/3 Plant Token, but with Transparency).

=== Stats ===
ATK: 2

HP: 2

Cost: 4

Abilities:
* Magic: Summon a Green Flower. Synergy: Give it base +2/+2. (Post Beta 46.0)
* Magic: Summon a Green Flower. Synergy: Summon a Red Flower instead. (Post Beta 52.1, Current)
Rarity: White (Common)
